==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*4 [[Coffin Zoge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*Infinite [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*5 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Ursamajor]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Coffin Zoge]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
While a Zombie Killer for the Coffin Zoges here isn't quite necessary, a good answer to Ursamajor is. However, most anti-Zombie backliners are capable of dealing with an Ursamajor, as can basic LD units.

